Fix build with LLVM 23

AMDGPU builtins take ext_vector_type operands (no implicit conversion) since
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/176033:
- vanilla LLVM 23 and 24 (main): gfx1250 WMMA operands need casts; the calls
  are not dependent, so this fails for every target
- AMD's LLVM fork (therock-10.1, amd-staging): still _Vector, builds without
  casts; full reland pending in https://github.com/ROCm/llvm-project/pull/4184
Cast them like https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-libraries/pull/4066 did for the
other specializations.
